# The arguments did not match the tool's schema: the capability was never
# called, and the problems say where. A loop would hand these back to the
# model as an error tool result; this door answers 422.
#
# `exists` first: a missing path compares equal to false in txcl, so a bare
# `._check0.ok == false` would fire on every request that ran no check.
WHEN exists ._check0 && ._check0.ok != true
  EMIT .error    = "the arguments do not match the tool's schema",
       .problems = ._check0.errors,
       .call     = ._turn.tool_calls.0,
       @web.res.status = 422,
       @halt = true
